From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: domicile CI <ci@domicile.invalid>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: the shell's mixer has meters

Registers the meters' member of the control protocol: an `audiolevels`
event, a DomicileAudioLevelsEvent of DomicileAudioLevels -- an id and its
peak -- answering DomicileHost.watchAudioLevels().

The event, its init dictionary, the level, the mojom members and the
request are new files and edits under src/; what cannot be is a name in a
generated-bindings list. Its context is the domicile block as 0085 leaves
it, for the reason 0045 gives.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`, and `guard-control-arrival.sh` fires the
`audiolevels` name in a real engine.
---
 .../blink/renderer/bindings/generated_in_modules.gni        | 6 ++++++
 third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/idl_in_modules.gni      | 3 +++
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+)

